# Copy to .env.local (git-ignored) and fill in. Vite loads it in dev, build and preview.
#
# VITE_COINGECKO_API_KEY: an optional CoinGecko Demo API key (free sign-up: 100 calls a minute, 10,000 a month).
# Leave it empty to use the keyless API: it needs no sign-up, but allows only about 5 calls a minute per IP.
# It is inlined into this remote's bundle and can't be restricted by URL, so use it for local work only.
VITE_COINGECKO_API_KEY=
